# luci-app-openclash backup list -- AX6000 lite firmware override
# (2026-11-25 v3). The package ships "/etc/openclash/" (whole dir),
# which drags the 10MB GeoSite.dat + rule_provider + mmdb + history
# into the sysupgrade backup (~11.5MB total); on 22MB free RAM the
# save stage hung ~10 min and the v2 flash died before writing
# (2026-11-25). Keep only small user data. The big files are NOT
# listed and are restored after upgrade:
# - GeoSite.dat (10MB): re-downloaded by OpenClash on first run.
# - clash_meta binary (57MB): baked into the image (/rom), restored
#   to /tmp on every boot by /etc/init.d/clash-kernel-restore.
# - cache.db: symlink to history/lj.db, recreated by OpenClash.
# The glob below is expanded by the shell in list_static_conffiles
# (/sbin/sysupgrade), so new *.yaml subscription files are picked up
# automatically; a non-matching glob contributes nothing.
/etc/openclash/config/*.yaml
/etc/openclash/fy.yaml
/etc/openclash/lj.yaml
/etc/openclash/custom/
/etc/openclash/overwrite/
/etc/openclash/history/
/etc/openclash/rule_provider/
/etc/openclash/Country.mmdb
/etc/openclash/china_ip_route.ipset
/etc/openclash/china_ip6_route.ipset
/etc/openclash/cache.db
/etc/openclash/clash
